# --- Form delivery ---------------------------------------------------------
# The site is hosted on Render as a static site, which cannot store form
# submissions. Set VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT below to deliver enquiries by email, or
# leave it empty and the form keeps its WhatsApp / email handoff behaviour.
#
# Netlify Forms support still exists but is opt-in: set VITE_NETLIFY_FORMS=true
# in a build that actually runs on Netlify. Do not set it on Render.

# Optional third-party endpoint that accepts a JSON POST. Takes precedence over
# Netlify Forms when set. Works with Formspree, Basin, Getform or your own API.
# The payload includes kind, name, business, email, phone, service, budget,
# timeline, description, contactMethod, conditional service details, and the
# formatted "message" text.
#
# Only put a public form endpoint here. Never add API secrets to a VITE_ variable.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=

# Opt-in Netlify Forms flag for a Netlify-hosted build. Leave unset on Render.
# VITE_NETLIFY_FORMS=true